    "summary": "Autocomplete system for the chat composer that triggers on \"@\" to let users mention project files or target specific agents. Fetches the project file tree, flattens it to a searchable list, applies fuzzy filtering as the user types, and presents a keyboard-navigable dropdown. Agent @mentions route the message to the selected agent.\n",
